	"notice": "No USB port: connect through a DIN MIDI interface and select this profile for that interface manually. Choose Global MIDI for one shared channel or Individual MIDI Channels for per-voice control. Pad notes and channels are configurable, so no fixed pad map is supplied. Updates and sound transfers also require a MIDI interface. Physical schematics show selected controls; no fixed CC map is implied.",
